<div id="Contentplaceholder1_C058_Col00" class="sf_colsIn container" data-sf-element="Container" data-placeholder-label="Container"><div class="row" data-sf-element="Row">
    <div id="Contentplaceholder1_C014_Col00" class="sf_colsIn col-lg-12" data-sf-element="Column 1" data-placeholder-label="Column 1">
<div >
    <div class="sf-Long-text" ><h1>Current Election Information</h1><hr></div>    
</div><div class="" data-sf-element="Row">
    <div id="Contentplaceholder1_C138_Col00" class="sf_colsIn col-lg-8" data-sf-element="Column 1" data-placeholder-label="Column 1">
<div >
    <div class="sf-Long-text" ><h3>November 3, 2026 Gubernatorial General Election</h3><p>Updates and relevant links will be provided as information becomes available.<b></b></p></div>    
</div>
<div >
    <div class="sf-Long-text" ><h3>Voter Information Tool</h3><p>Find the closest polling location and drop box to you by entering in an address below:</p></div>    
</div>
<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="https://votinginfotool.org/css/compiled/vit.css"/>
<script src="https://votinginfotool.org/js/compiled/app.js"></script>
<div id="vit-size-container" class="vit-size-container" style="width: 100%; height: 100%;">
  <div id="_vit"></div>
</div>
<script>
  var config = {
    "logo": {"type":"default"},
    "official-only": true
  };
  var loadVIT = function () {
    if (typeof vit !== 'undefined'){
      vit.core.init("_vit", config);
    } else {
      setTimeout(loadVIT, 500);
    };
  };
  loadVIT();
</script>
<div >
    <div class="sf-Long-text" ><p><br></p><table style="width: 730px; height: 1262.5px"><tbody><tr height="56" style="height: 72.5px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/current-election/sj-composite-eng-(1).pdf?sfvrsn=98168b81_1">County Voter Information Guide - English</a><br><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/current-election/sj-composite-spa-(1).pdf?sfvrsn=7500237e_1">County Voter Information Guide - Spanish</a><br></td><td style="width: 478.156px">The County Voter Information Guide (CVIG) is a valuable resource that provides essential information to help voters prepare for casting their ballots.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 72.5px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" target="_blank" href="https://voterguide.sos.ca.gov/">State Voter Guide</a><br></td><td style="width: 478.156px">The State Voter Information Guide (SVIG) is a valuable resource that provides important statewide information to assist voters in preparing to cast their ballots.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 53.8281px"><td><a href="/department/rov/election-information/current_election/facsimile">Facsimile Ballots
                </a></td><td>A facsimile ballot for the current election is available in the following languages: Burmese, Chinese, Hmong, Iu Mien, Khmer, Korean, Lao, Pashto, Punjabi, Tagalog, Thai, and Vietnamese.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 54.5781px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/current-election/ballot-replacement-application-november-2026_eng.pdf?sfvrsn=7027dfef_1">Replacement Ballot Application - English</a><br><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/current-election/ballot-replacement-application-november-2026_sp.pdf?sfvrsn=a4a1a41_2">Replacement Ballot Application - Spanish</a><a href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/office/forms/eng_replacement-application-v2.pdf?sfvrsn=be32b9f0_9"></a></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Request form for a new ballot if yours was lost, damaged, or never arrived.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 54.5781px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/current-election/representative-application-november-2026_eng.pdf?sfvrsn=18d97bff_1">Representative Application - English</a><br><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/current-election/representative-application-november-2026_sp.pdf?sfvrsn=f212a996_1">Representative Application - Spanish</a></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Authorization form to allow a representative to pick up a replacement ballot on your behalf.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 54.5781px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/office/forms/combined-cure-letter---ccrov-24210-(online-version)-(eng).pdf?sfvrsn=df8be8f1_20">Ballot Cure Letter - English</a><br><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/office/forms/combined-cure-letter---ccrov-24210-(online-version)-(sp).pdf?sfvrsn=7ce71ba4_26">Ballot Cure Letter -&nbsp;Spanish</a><br></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Step-by-step guide to fix problems with your ballot (like a missing or mismatched signature).</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 54.5781px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/current-election-general-2024/registration/cancellation-request-forms/cancellation-request-form-english.pdf?sfvrsn=54e16b30_3">Voter Cancellation Request - English</a><br><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/current-election-general-2024/registration/cancellation-request-forms/cancellation-request-form-spanish.pdf?sfvrsn=5b87a7b4_3">Voter Cancellation Request - Spanish</a></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Request form to cancel your California Voter Registration.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 72.5px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" target="_blank" href="https://www.sjgov.org/department/rov/voting/registration-info/military-and-overseas-voters">UOCAVA Voters</a></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Information for military and overseas voters covered by the Uniformed and Overseas Citizens Absentee Voting Act.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 54.5781px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" target="_blank" href="https://www.sjgov.org/department/rov/accessibility/accessible-ballots-and-sample-ballots">Accessible Vote by Mail</a></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Details on accessible vote-by-mail options for voters with disabilities.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 53.8281px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" target="_blank" href="https://www.sjgov.org/department/rov/election-information/current_election/ballot-drop-box-locations">Ballot Drop Box Locations</a><br></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Location and hours of operation of Drop Boxes.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 54.5781px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a href="https://share.earthcam.net/public/tJ90CoLmq7TzrY396Yd88PBwq80A5D-L7dRIC31fBpw/san_joaquin_election_2026/sjc-01/live" target="_blank" data-sf-ec-immutable="">Live Drop-Box Camera Feeds</a><br></td><td style="width: 478.156px">24/7 live video feeds of official ballot drop boxes for added transparency.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 54.5781px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/statewide-special-election-2025/election-resources/polling_places.xls?sfvrsn=69b437eb_3"></a><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/current-election/podr091_votinglocationlist.pdf?sfvrsn=76dabe2a_2">Polling Locations</a><br></td><td style="width: 478.156px">List of in-person polling locations.&nbsp;</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 54.5781px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/current-election/podr014_publication-10-9-2026.pdf?sfvrsn=a5ecfa46_5">Polling Places and Election Officers Publication</a></td><td style="width: 478.156px">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 53.8281px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" target="_blank" href="https://sjc-gis.maps.arcgis.com/apps/instant/sidebar/index.html?appid=83ae854bca6c43749f268f8f06e811b2">Congressional District Map Look-Up Tool</a></td><td style="width: 478.156px">New California Congressional Districts passed by Prop 50, to be used from 2026 through 2030.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 53.8281px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" target="_blank" href="https://sjc-gis.maps.arcgis.com/apps/instant/sidebar/index.html?appid=a073b0efc40d4be09a7a000ca09d143f">Interactive Voting Locations and Precinct Map</a></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Searchable Map by Address for Voting Precincts with Polling Places, and Ballot Drop Boxes</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 53.8281px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/current-election/2026-general-election-voting-precinct-to-regular-precinct-association-list.pdf?sfvrsn=d53c63f9_1">2026 General Election Voting Precinct to Regular Precinct Association List PDF</a></td><td style="width: 478.156px">2026 General Election Voting Precinct to Regular Precinct Association List</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 54.5781px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" target="_blank" href="https://sjgov.org/department/rov/voting/drive-up-ballot-drop-off">Drive-Thru Ballot Drop-Off</a><br></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Special drive-thru lane for fast, in-person ballot drop-off without leaving your car.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 54.5781px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a data-sf-ec-immutable="" target="_blank" href="https://california.ballottrax.net/voter/">Where’s My Ballot?</a></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Free service to track your vote-by-mail ballot and get status updates by email, text, or call.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 54.5781px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/current-election/san-joaquin-county-l-a-testing-2026gen.pdf?sfvrsn=96dd0b55_1">Logic &amp; Accuracy Testing</a><br></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Full Testing of the vote counting equipment before ballot processing begins for the election.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 53.8281px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><p><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/upcoming-election-documents/nov-26-measure-calendar.pdf?sfvrsn=ce3c29fe_3"></a><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/upcoming-election-documents/nov-26-measure-calendar.pdf?sfvrsn=ce3c29fe_3">Measure Calendar</a></p></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Timeline for placing local measure on the ballot.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 53.8281px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a href="https://elections.saccounty.gov/us/en/election-information/current-measure-information.html#gsc.tab=0" data-sf-ec-immutable="">Measure G Information</a></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Measure submitted by Galt Joint Union High School District. Sacramento County is the lead county. Link is to their website.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 117.5px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><div><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/notice-of-a-measure-t_eng_final.pdf?sfvrsn=e3fb14dc_9">Notice of Measure T - English</a></div><div><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/notice-of-a-measure-t_sp_final.pdf?sfvrsn=f862ad87_9">Notice of Measure T - Spanish</a>
 <div><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/measure-t-impartial-analysis---english.pdf?sfvrsn=3dfab80a_3">Impartial Analysis - English</a></div><div><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/measure-t-impartial-analysis---spanish.pdf?sfvrsn=be511be2_3">Impartial Analysis - Spanish</a></div><div><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/notice-of-argument-in-favor-of-measure-t---english.pdf?sfvrsn=e033b110_3">Notice of Argument In Favor - English</a></div><div><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/measure_t_argument_in_favor_spanish.pdf?sfvrsn=99369cfb_3">Notice of Argument In Favor - Spanish</a></div><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/notice-of-a-measure-t_sp_final.pdf?sfvrsn=f862ad87_9"><br data-sf-ec-immutable=""></a><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/notice-of-a-measure-t_sp_final.pdf?sfvrsn=f862ad87_9"></a></div></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Measure submitted by Lodi Unified School District.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 117.5px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><div><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/notice-of-a-measure-u_eng_final.pdf?sfvrsn=5600c7b7_6">Notice of Measure U - English</a></div><div><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/notice-of-a-measure-u_sp_final.pdf?sfvrsn=905ca536_9">Notice of Measure U - Spanish</a>
 <div><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/measure-u-impartial-analysis---english.pdf?sfvrsn=e2447b4f_3">Impartial Analysis - English</a></div><div><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/measure-u-impartial-analysis---spanish.pdf?sfvrsn=226febe4_3">Impartial Analysis - Spanish</a>
 <div><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/notice-of-argument-in-favor-measure-u.pdf?sfvrsn=8bc75483_3">Notice of Argument In Favor - English</a></div><div><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/measure-u_argument-in-favor_sp.pdf?sfvrsn=54b9913_1">Notice of Argument In Favor - Spanish</a></div></div><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/notice-of-a-measure-u_sp_final.pdf?sfvrsn=905ca536_9"><br data-sf-ec-immutable=""></a><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/notice-of-a-measure-u_sp_final.pdf?sfvrsn=905ca536_9"></a></div></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Measure submitted by Escalon Unified School District.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 117.5px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/legal-november-3-2026-measure-calendar.pdf?sfvrsn=c8c16801_5">Measure Calendar (Legal Deadlines)</a></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Measure Calendar with legal deadlines.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 117.5px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><div><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/v_english-rn-44458773.pdf?sfvrsn=482878c9_3">Notice of Measure V - English</a></div><div><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/v_spanish-rn-44458855.pdf?sfvrsn=bf2ac621_3">Notice of Measure V - Spanish</a></div><div><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/measure-v-impartial-analysis---english.pdf?sfvrsn=6f2dcbe1_3">Impartial Analysis - English</a></div><div><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/measure_v_impartial_analysis_sp.pdf?sfvrsn=3b3cc438_1">Impartial Analysis - Spanish</a></div></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Measure submitted by Lincoln Unified School District</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 53.8281px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a href="https://www.sos.ca.gov/elections/ballot-measures/qualified-ballot-measures" data-sf-ec-immutable="">Statewide Propositions</a></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Link to the California Secretary of State's list of statewide measure that have qualified for the ballot.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 54.5781px"><td style="width: 364.844px">ROV Open Tours<br><em>Available during all operational hours</em></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Guided tours of the elections office, including demos of how ballots are processed.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 54.5781px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/current-election/election-observer-documents/election-observer-guidelines-2024.pdf?sfvrsn=74d89f89_6">Election Observer Guidelines</a><br><br></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Rules and procedures for members of the public who wish to observe the election process.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 53.8281px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/statewide-special-election-2025/general-documents/one-percent-manual-tally---2025-statewide-special.pdf?sfvrsn=171e655e_3"></a>1% Random Drawing of Precincts<br></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Random selection of precincts for the 1% Manual Tally.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 53.8281px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/statewide-special-election-2025/general-documents/one-percent-manual-tally---2025-statewide-special.pdf?sfvrsn=171e655e_3"></a><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/statewide-special-election-2025/general-documents/one-percent-manual-tally---2025-statewide-special.pdf?sfvrsn=171e655e_3"></a><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/statewide-special-election-2025/general-documents/one-percent-manual-tally---2025-statewide-special.pdf?sfvrsn=171e655e_3"></a>1% Manual Tally Results<br></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Results of the 1% Manual Tally to verify election accuracy.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 54.5781px"><td style="width: 364.844px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/current-election/102326_reporting-schedule_rov_final.pdf?sfvrsn=9044b4f7_1">Election Night Reporting Schedule</a><br></td><td style="width: 478.156px">Timeline of when election results will be posted, beginning at 8:00 PM on Election Night.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 56.25px"><td style="width: 364.844px">Final Certification &amp; Turnout Stats<br>(Coming Soon)</td><td style="width: 478.156px">Official final results and voter turnout numbers after the election is certified.</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><div contenteditable="false" data-role="draggable"><div></div></div><div contenteditable="false" data-role="draggable"><div></div></div><div contenteditable="false" data-role="draggable"><div></div></div><div contenteditable="false" data-role="draggable"><div></div></div><div contenteditable="false" data-role="draggable"><div></div></div><div contenteditable="false" data-role="draggable"><div></div></div><div contenteditable="false" data-role="draggable"><div></div></div><div contenteditable="false" data-role="draggable"><div></div></div><p>&nbsp;</p></div>    
</div>
<div >
    <div class="sf-Long-text" ><h3><strong>Candidate and Election Resources</strong></h3><p>The Registrar of Voters provides comprehensive information on all aspects of candidacy for local offices, including a list of open offices for each election. These documents are available at the Registrar of Voters' Office or can be downloaded using the links below.</p></div>    
</div>
<div >
    <div class="sf-Long-text" ><p>&nbsp;</p><br><table style="width: 740px; height: 921px"><tbody><tr height="56" style="height: 50px"><td style="width: 264.141px"><a href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/upcoming-election-documents/nov-26-abbreviated-election-calendar.pdf?sfvrsn=9fa6462_6">Abbreviated Election Calendar</a></td><td style="width: 339.859px">Key election dates and deadlines for candidates and voters</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 27.5px"><td style="width: 264.141px"><a href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/upcoming-election-documents/nov-26-measure-calendar.pdf?sfvrsn=ce3c29fe_3">Measure Calendar</a></td><td style="width: 339.859px">Timeline for placing local measures on the ballot.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 27.5px"><td style="width: 264.141px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/candidates/measure-guide-2025.pdf?sfvrsn=ca80e9bb_8">Measure Guide</a></td><td style="width: 339.859px">Guide for those who wish to place a measure on the ballot.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 117.5px"><td style="width: 264.141px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/candidates/2026-general-offices-up-for-election.pdf?sfvrsn=cc290109_38"></a><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/offices-up-for-2026-general-election.pdf?sfvrsn=9d3a8055_13">Offices Up for Election</a></td><td style="width: 339.859px">List of local offices scheduled for election.<br><br><em>Note: Information in this section is subject to change without notice. Updates will be provided closer to the candidate filing period.</em></td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 27.5px"><td style="width: 264.141px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/candidates/candidate-guide.pdf?sfvrsn=d0285d54_24">Candidate Guide</a><br></td><td style="width: 339.859px">Step-by-step filing and eligibility instructions.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 72.5px"><td style="width: 264.141px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/candidates/statement-of-qualifications-(2).pdf?sfvrsn=69b36788_6">Statement of Qualifications</a><br></td><td style="width: 339.859px">Form for submitting a candidate statement of qualifications for publication in the San Joaquin County voter information guide.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 252.5px"><td style="width: 264.141px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/gubernatorial-primary-election-2026/candidate-services/candidate-roster-(26).pdf?sfvrsn=d95354d6_47"></a><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/candidate-roster-(35).pdf?sfvrsn=8b61f2ae_100"></a><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/offices-up-for-2026-general-election.pdf?sfvrsn=9d3a8055_13"></a><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/candidate-roster-(35).pdf?sfvrsn=8b61f2ae_100">Local Candidate Roster</a><br></td><td style="width: 339.859px"><div>This roster includes the names of local candidates who have completed and filed all required nomination documents for countywide offices.</div><div><br></div><div>The list is updated daily at 5:00 p.m. Candidates who file after 2:00 p.m. will be added on the next business day.</div><div><br></div><div>Please note:</div><div>We only post candidates for countywide offices.</div><div>For information regarding state or city candidates, please contact those offices directly.</div></td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 72.5px"><td style="width: 264.141px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/offices-in-extension-(1).pdf?sfvrsn=4d78bce3_1">Offices in Extension</a><br></td><td style="width: 339.859px">Extended nomination deadlines for uncontested offices. This extension applies only to candidates who are not incumbents.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 72.5px"><td style="width: 264.141px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/candidate-services/roster-writein-10-06.pdf?sfvrsn=67e4b93f_1">List of Qualified Write-In Candidates</a><br><br></td><td style="width: 339.859px">Names of state and local write-in candidates who have qualified for the ballot.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 50px"><td style="width: 264.141px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/current-election/state-random-alphabet-11.3.26.pdf?sfvrsn=beaa8e36_5">State Randomized Drawing</a><br></td><td style="width: 339.859px">Alphabetical order for candidate names, as determined by the Secretary of State.</td></tr><tr height="56" style="height: 72.5px"><td style="width: 264.141px"><a target="_blank" href="/docs/default-source/registrar-of-voters-documents/elections/gubernatorial-general-election-2026/current-election/county-random-alphabet-11.3.26.pdf?sfvrsn=cf3a2154_5">County Randomized Drawing</a><br></td><td style="width: 339.859px">Alphabetical order for candidate names, as determined by San Joaquin County for multi-county legislative races.<br><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div>    
</div>
    </div>
    <div id="Contentplaceholder1_C138_Col01" class="sf_colsIn col-lg-4" data-sf-element="Column 2" data-placeholder-label="Column 2">








